      "numeric_scheme": null,
      "numeric_id": null,
      "original_position": 1,
      "content": "[Fri 2026-09-04 15:00 GMT+8] 请使用中文回复，除非用户明确使用其他语言。\n\n请使用技能「收发邮件」协助当前任务。\n我要发送【126/163/qq】邮件，请引导我获取授权码，给自己发送邮件：主题【测试】，内容【测试】"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_2d12a63ea24f:411dcc36",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 36865,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": null,
      "numeric_id": null,
      "original_position": 2,
      "content": "收到！我先检查一下邮件技能的环境和已有配置，然后引导你完成授权码设置。"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_2d12a63ea24f:01bfb1ab",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 36866,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": null,
      "numeric_id": null,
      "original_position": 3,
      "content": "技能目录不在预期位置，我找一下实际路径："
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_2d12a63ea24f:225cbf36",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 36867,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": null,
      "numeric_id": null,
      "original_position": 4,
      "content": "找到了技能目录，检查依赖和配置状态："
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_2d12a63ea24f:064e800f",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 36868,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": null,
